            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Julia Haase Wolfe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love these but change slightly. One can 12 oz frozen pink lemonade (pulp kind the best), fill that can with vodka, then add just two beers. Mix, then fill pitcer with ice and serve. Very good not as strong as with three beers as stated in original recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2009-04-30T06:38:08.623Z"
          },
          {
